## Configure search delegates and search updates

Ensure your view controller conforms to `UISearchResultsUpdating` and `UISearchBarDelegate` protocols to handle text entry and filter search results efficiently across different device capabilities.

- UISearchBarDelegate
- delegate

```swift
extension SearchContainerViewController: UISearchResultsUpdating, UISearchBarDelegate {
    func updateSearchResultsFor(searchController: UISearchController) {
        guard let searchText = searchController.searchBar.text else { return }
        resultsController.filterContent(for: searchText)
    }
}
```

